s=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels\" title=\"The Night Revels\">The Night Revels</a></b>, Turn in <a href=\"/page/Item:Cloak_of_Night_(level_8)\" title=\"Item:Cloak of Night (level 8)\">Cloak of Night (level 8)</a><br /><div style=\"display: inline-block; width: 24px;\">&#160;</div>and <b>100</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_PieceOfDarkestChocolate.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\">Piece of Darkest Chocolate</a></b>, obtained in the <a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels_-_Delera%27s_Graveyard\" title=\"The Night Revels - Delera&#39;s Graveyard\">Crypt</a>, in <a href=\"/page/Category:Challenges_in_Night_Revels_Crypt\" title=\"Category:Challenges in Night Revels Crypt\">any challenge</a>, and via <a href=\"/page/Item:Draught_of_Midnight\" title=\"Item:Draught of Midnight\">Draught of Midnight</a></span></span><b>40</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Shadowy_Caramel\" title=\"Item:Shadowy Caramel\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_ShadowyCaramel.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Shadowy_Caramel\" title=\"Item:Shadowy Caramel\">Shadowy Caramel</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/Getting_Ahead_in_Lordsmarch_Palace\" title=\"Getting Ahead in Lordsmarch Palace\">Getting Ahead in Lordsmarch Palace</a></span></span><b>20</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Pinch_of_Sinister_Cinnamon\" title=\"Item:Pinch of Sinister Cinnamon\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_PinchOfSinisterCinnamon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Pinch_of_Sinister_Cinnamon\" title=\"Item:Pinch of Sinister Cinnamon\">Pinch of Sinister Cinnamon</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/Hayweird_Foundry\" title=\"Hayweird Foundry\">Hayweird Foundry</a>, <a href=\"/page/The_Snitch_and_the_Lich\" title=\"The Snitch and the Lich\">The Snitch and the Lich</a></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Invisibility_Guard\" title=\"Invisibility Guard\">Invisibility&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Invisibility_Guard\" title=\"Invisibility Guard\">Invisibility&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item has a chance of granting you temporary invisibility when you are hit by foes. The invisibility will not be removed when you attack or take damage, but it will wear off after 10 seconds.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dusk_(enchantment)\" title=\"Dusk (enchantment)\">Dusk</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Dusk_(enchantment)\" title=\"Dusk (enchantment)\">Dusk</a>:</b> Equipping this item engulfs you in twilight shadows. Attacks from enemies have a 10% chance to miss you due to concealment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Deathblock\" title=\"Deathblock\">Deathblock</a>:</b> The wearer of this item is immune to all death spells and magical death effects.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Cloak_of_Night_(level_12).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Cloak_of_Night_%28level_12%29.png/420px-Cloak_of_Night_%28level_12%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"356\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Cloak_of_Night_%28level_12%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\"><a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Cloak_of_Night_(level_16)\" title=\"Item:Cloak of Night (level 16)\">Cloak of Night (level 16)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This Cloak is as smooth and dark as the most pitch-black of nights. Wearing it makes you difficult to spot and attack, and by awakening its powers you will enable it to aid you against creatures native to the darkness.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817202236\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3546/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32461/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12191/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n111.47%  146.786     52 Template:IO\n100.00%  131.686      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  131.686      1 -total\n 95.99%  126.400      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 39.33%   51.789      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 37.93%   49.950      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 36.69%   48.310      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 34.75%   45.761      2 Template:InCategory\n 31.03%   40.858      8 Template:Popup\n 14.87%   19.587      1 Template:NightRevelsRecipe\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12391-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817202236 and revision id 663129. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
